#: banking/klarna_kosma_integration/doctype/bank_reconciliation_tool_beta/unpaid_vouchers.py:708
msgid "Automatic handling of the included bank fee is not supported for foreign-currency bank accounts when reconciling this voucher. Payment Entry deductions must be in company currency ({0}), but this Bank Transaction fee is in {1}. Please reconcile and book the fee manually with a Journal Entry if appropriate."
